Krono's Battle Zone: controls
=============================

From the author's read-me (ReadMe-KronoBattleZone). The menus are in
Spanish: JUGAR = play, OPCIONES = options, SALIR = quit.

Player 1 (top half, or the whole screen against the computer)
  Move          cursor keys, or keypad 8 4 6 2 (5 also)
  Shoot         Insert, keypad 0 or keypad Enter
  Lights        Del or keypad 3 (at night)
  Turn turret   Home, Page Up, or keypad 7 and 9

Player 2 (bottom half)
  Move          W S A D
  Shoot         R
  Lights        F (at night)
  Turn turret   Q and E

  Esc           end the game (or the demo)
  Pause         pause; Return carries on

Amiga keyboards have no Insert/Home/Page Up keys: use the keypad.
The settings (screen size, computer skill, details) are kept in the
drawer's User drawer, User/krbz.cfg.
